units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p

region simulation_box block 0 8 0 8 0 8 units box
create_box 2 simulation_box
create_atoms 1 single 3.00 4.00 4.00 units box
create_atoms 2 single 3.95 4.00 4.00 units box
create_atoms 1 single 2.80 4.92 4.00 units box
mass 1 1.008
mass 2 15.999

newton on
neighbor 0.5 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
pair_style mamba device auto
pair_coeff * * model.mtace.pt H O

thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms pe press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
run 0
